{"3370530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snatcher: Peculiar Deliveries", "steam_appid": 3370530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon arsenal might be limited, but that doesn't mean you are out of options, scattered around the levels there will be plenty of things you can use in your advantage. They say that a pen is mightier than a sword... <br><br>I'd recommend something heavier, like a brick for example~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/1305b34d81c76962226a4760f6f3da69.poster.avif?t=1787595579\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/1305b34d81c76962226a4760f6f3da69.webm?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/1305b34d81c76962226a4760f6f3da69.mp4?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might also stumble on destructible props that when broken down can be used as a weapons or maybe trigger a trap that will help you out when outnumbered. <br><br>So keep your eyes peeled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/126bfab8d1657379e0b9378fd68e7007.poster.avif?t=1787595579\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/126bfab8d1657379e0b9378fd68e7007.webm?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/126bfab8d1657379e0b9378fd68e7007.mp4?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-drawn world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submerge yourself into completely hand-drawn world that's brought to life using hand made animations of both the enemies that you will encounter and environment details that may or may not have bigger impact on the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/a66fd11939c693dd4b3e6052b30c4e1b.poster.avif?t=1787595579\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/a66fd11939c693dd4b3e6052b30c4e1b.webm?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/a66fd11939c693dd4b3e6052b30c4e1b.mp4?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon arsenal might be limited, but that doesn't mean you are out of options, scattered around the levels there will be plenty of things you can use in your advantage. They say that a pen is mightier than a sword... <br><br>I'd recommend something heavier, like a brick for example~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/1305b34d81c76962226a4760f6f3da69.poster.avif?t=1787595579\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/1305b34d81c76962226a4760f6f3da69.webm?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/1305b34d81c76962226a4760f6f3da69.mp4?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might also stumble on destructible props that when broken down can be used as a weapons or maybe trigger a trap that will help you out when outnumbered. <br><br>So keep your eyes peeled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/126bfab8d1657379e0b9378fd68e7007.poster.avif?t=1787595579\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/126bfab8d1657379e0b9378fd68e7007.webm?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/126bfab8d1657379e0b9378fd68e7007.mp4?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-drawn world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submerge yourself into completely hand-drawn world that's brought to life using hand made animations of both the enemies that you will encounter and environment details that may or may not have bigger impact on the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/a66fd11939c693dd4b3e6052b30c4e1b.poster.avif?t=1787595579\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/a66fd11939c693dd4b3e6052b30c4e1b.webm?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/extras/a66fd11939c693dd4b3e6052b30c4e1b.mp4?t=1787595579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are tasked with fighting your way to snatch and deliver anything your mysterious patron demands. Use your surroundings to gain the edge over your enemies, as you never know what might come in handy in this hand-drawn, fantasy FPS boomer shooter.", "supported_languages": "English, Czech", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/0d7cdee067957c519766d22df2468f70c9fe638a/header.jpg?t=1787595579", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/1d9dd5574675a4644aa159fa7ce0a609279926a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787595579", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/1d9dd5574675a4644aa159fa7ce0a609279926a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787595579", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Matej Ptacek"], "publishers": ["Matej Ptacek"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/7e8a25f2a43168643574c5f592bd111ad044b62c/ss_7e8a25f2a43168643574c5f592bd111ad044b62c.600x338.jpg?t=1787595579", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370530/7e8a25f2a431686